  "researchNotes": "Research conducted via Southwark Council website, search results, and public documents. Main offices at 160 Tooley Street SE1 2QH. Postal address PO Box 64529 SE1P 5LX. Statement of Licensing Policy 2021-2026 in force, draft 2026-2031 in consultation. Three Cumulative Impact Areas: Borough and Bankside, Camberwell, Peckham. Comprehensive property licensing: mandatory HMO, additional HMO (borough-wide since March 2022), selective licensing (19 wards since November 2023). 43,000 privately rented homes in borough. Police licensing email not directly confirmed - recommend contacting licensing@southwark.gov.uk for Appendix A responsible authority details. Borough Market located in Southwark. Gold Standard Charter offers fee discounts for landlords."
